\theta\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_S\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_S\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d1b845cf0812591a\" href=\"?note=d1b845cf0812591a\" title=\"57-df-substitution\">57-df-substitution</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HU}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{var}\">\\(\\mathrm{var}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_S\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d1505219185e27a3\" href=\"?note=d1505219185e27a3\" title=\"57-df-herbrand-universe\">57-df-herbrand-universe</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"16a587bb999452b8\" href=\"?note=16a587bb999452b8\" title=\"57-df-var-in-term\">57-df-var-in-term</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"053d3ef4d2401abe\" href=\"?note=053d3ef4d2401abe\" title=\"57-df-term\">57-df-term</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ran}\">\\(\\mathrm{ran}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"a23da7b2fd81c2fb\" href=\"?note=a23da7b2fd81c2fb\" title=\"57-df-range.md\">57-df-range.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GroundSubst}_S\\coloneqq\\{\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_S:\n\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{dom}(\\theta)\\;\\mathrm{var}(\\theta(x))=\\emptyset\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{GroundSubst}_S\\coloneqq\\{\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_S:\n\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{dom}(\\theta)\\;\\mathrm{var}(\\theta(x))=\\emptyset\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathrm{GroundSubst}_S\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ran}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\mathrm{HU}(S),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{GroundSubst}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{GroundSubst}_S.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\theta\\in\\mathrm{GroundSubst}_S\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ran}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\mathrm{HU}(S),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{GroundSubst}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{GroundSubst}_S.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>非变量项不一定是基项，例如 f(x) 仍含变量。修正原先两个互相冲突的等价式，保留基代换的原意与名称。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"d1b845cf0812591a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-herbrand-universe","status":"resolved","id":"d1505219185e27a3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-herbrand-universe]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-var-in-term","status":"resolved","id":"16a587bb999452b8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-var-in-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"053d3ef4d2401abe","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-range.md","status":"resolved","id":"a23da7b2fd81c2fb","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-range.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"d1b845cf0812591a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_S$，见 [[57-df-substitution]]；$\\mathrm{HU}(S)$、$\\mathrm{var}$、$\\mathrm{Term}_S$ 见 [[57-df-herbrand-universe]]、[[57-df-var-in-term]]、[[57-df-term]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-herbrand-universe","status":"resolved